title: Test whether a waking mind does better with skg than with a folder of the same notes.
pid: ab03065e-c342-4f88-8eb7-8e3d11c2cbcd
body: |2-
  Fresh minds holding nothing answer the same probes about one
  specialist's next mission, once from its graph through skg-for-ai,
  once from the same notes as plain Org files in folders under Git.
  Count right answers, and tokens read to reach them.
contains:
